  "title": "Little Meat Loaves",
  "description": "These individual meat loaves are topped with a sweet and tangy sauce. The sausage in this recipe yields a more complex flavor than your standard meat loaf.",
  "authors": [
    "ELIZABETH 45"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-04-16T22:30:26-04:00",
